[715 1 "// noFrameGlobals is the globals of a call with no Python frame: the running __main__'s"] [716 1 "// (_PyEval_GetGlobalsFromRunningMain), else a new dict."] [727 1 "// frameLocals is locals() of a frame (PEP 667): a module's or class's namespace (its mapping when that is no dict;"] [728 1 "// frameNamespace), else a new dict of a function's bound fast locals, cells and free variables, then its extra locals (the proxy's"] [729 1 "// snapshot, _PyEval_GetFrameLocals: a write to it does not reach the frame)."] [732 27 "// a call with no Python frame (an interpreter's call, queue 230)"] [764 1 "// builtinDir is dir(): the scope's names, or an object's __dir__() sorted (PY5c's lookup); without a"] [765 1 "// __dir__, a module's namespace, a type's and its bases', an object's type's and its __dict__'s."] [788 3 "// the object's __dir__ (object's, type's, module's, a class's own: PY5c's), its result sorted"] [804 3 "// the scope's names: a mapping not a dict (exec's locals; queue 219) by its keys"] [809 4 "// PyMapping_Keys"] [910 1 "// roundFloat is float.__round__ (Objects/floatobject.c's double_round): to an int, ties to even, without"] [911 1 "// ndigits; else the correctly rounded value at ndigits decimal places (round-half-even on the exact decimal"] [912 1 "// value, as dtoa's mode 3), negative ndigits rounding to tens, hundreds ..."] [934 2 "// the exact decimal value of x, rounded half-even at n places after the point"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[20 48] [26 49] [40 47] [58 46] [64 48] [74 52] [89 41] [99 38] [108 41] [121 41] [137 52] [140 32] [146 51] [178 31] [217 59] [221 32] [232 35] [259 46] [263 22] [273 28] [276 43] [306 34] [326 44] [381 45] [404 43] [418 43] [432 46] [449 46] [457 43] [475 45] [483 23] [497 39] [504 49] [507 50] [513 37] [542 25] [558 20] [558 28] [570 32] [597 40] [600 43] [615 37] [618 40] [631 37] [634 40] [640 34] [709 44] [720 54] [734 28] [742 37] [745 40] [751 31] [767 36] [770 39] [780 24] [789 54] [